# DevOps/Kubernetes Project Tasks
# Copy to project root as .tasks

# Local Development
0|Dev Setup|docker-compose up -d|Start local environment
0|Dev Logs|docker-compose logs -f|View logs
0|Dev Stop|docker-compose down|Stop local environment
0|Dev Fresh|docker-compose down -v && docker-compose up -d|Fresh local environment

# Build & Push
0|Docker|SUB|Docker build & push
1|Build Image|docker build -t app:latest .|Build Docker image
1|Tag Image|docker tag app:latest registry.example.com/app:v1.0|Tag image
1|Push Image|docker push registry.example.com/app:v1.0|Push to registry
1|Back|BACK

# Kubernetes
0|Kubernetes|SUB|Kubernetes environments
1|K8s Dev|SUB|Dev environment
2|K8s Dev Apply|kubectl apply -f k8s/dev/|Apply dev manifests
2|K8s Dev Status|kubectl get pods -n dev|Check dev status
2|K8s Dev Logs|kubectl logs -f deployment/app -n dev|Dev logs
2|K8s Dev Delete|kubectl delete -f k8s/dev/|Delete dev deployment
2|Back|BACK
1|K8s Staging|SUB|Staging environment
2|K8s Stage Apply|kubectl apply -f k8s/staging/|Apply staging manifests
2|K8s Stage Status|kubectl get pods -n staging|Check staging status
2|K8s Stage Rollout|kubectl rollout status deployment/app -n staging|Staging rollout
2|K8s Stage Restart|kubectl rollout restart deployment/app -n staging|Restart staging
2|Back|BACK
1|K8s Production|SUB|Production environment
2|K8s Prod Apply|kubectl apply -f k8s/prod/|Apply prod manifests
2|K8s Prod Status|kubectl get pods -n prod|Check prod status
2|K8s Prod Rollback|kubectl rollout undo deployment/app -n prod|Rollback prod
2|K8s Prod Restart|kubectl rollout restart deployment/app -n prod|Restart prod
2|Back|BACK
1|Back|BACK

# Monitoring
0|Monitoring|SUB|Monitoring and logs
1|Prometheus|port-forward svc/prometheus 9090:9090 -n monitoring|Access Prometheus
1|Grafana|port-forward svc/grafana 3000:3000 -n monitoring|Access Grafana
1|Logs Stack|kubectl logs -f deployment/logging -n monitoring|View logging stack
1|Back|BACK

# Cluster
0|Cluster|SUB|Cluster management
1|Cluster Info|kubectl cluster-info|Cluster information
1|Nodes|kubectl get nodes|List nodes
1|Namespaces|kubectl get namespaces|List namespaces
1|Resources|kubectl top nodes|Resource usage
1|Back|BACK

# Maintenance
0|Maintenance|SUB|Maintenance & cleanup
1|DB Backup|mysqldump -u root -p prod_db > backup_$(date +%Y%m%d).sql|Backup database
1|Cert Renew|kubectl apply -f k8s/certs/|Renew certificates
1|Security Scan|kubectl audit|Security audit
1|Cleanup|kubectl delete pod --field-selector status.phase=Failed|Cleanup failed pods
1|Back|BACK

# Full Deployment
0|Deploy All|run build && run --across dev,staging,prod deploy [depends: Build Image]|Full deployment pipeline

0|Exit|EXIT|Close menu
